{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118398","id":3516428895,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RmHJf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118398","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118398.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118398.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118398","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118398/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118398/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118398/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8ff5e917ea5c2cbd97eef5b00f68efca58ee76af","number":118398,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"AudioStreamPlaylist: Dynamic Looping and Playback Controls","user":{"login":"avanwinkle","id":5777240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzcyNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5777240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle","html_url":"https://github.com/avanwinkle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avanwinkle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR enhances the `AudioStreamPlaylist` and corresponding `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist` for dynamic control of looping during playback.\r\n\r\nIt builds on the work by @GustJc started in #95900 and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10508\r\n\r\n## Details\r\n\r\nThe core functionality added is the `AudioStreamPlaylist.set_loop_stream(bool)` to toggle whether the current stream should loop or not. This can be done in realtime during playback, allowing the dynamic looping of streams indefinitely and seamlessly transitioning to other streams in the playlist when desired.\r\n\r\nThe Playback node also gains some enhanced features to dynamically manage playback:\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.change_stream(stream_index)` to jump to a specific stream\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.next_stream()` to advance to the next stream\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.previous_stream()` to back up to the previous stream\r\n\r\nAnd some methods for knowing more about what's playing:\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.get_current_stream_index()` to know what playlist stream is currently playing\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.get_stream_playback_position()` to get the timecode of the current stream\r\n\r\nThere are also two signals added to trigger behavior based on stream loops and changes:\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.stream_changed` emitted when playback moves to a different stream\r\n* `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist.stream looped` emitted when a looping stream completes and starts a new loop\r\n\r\n## Sample Code\r\n\r\nHere is a sample of using these new features!\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _process(delta):\r\n  process_time += delta\r\n  if process_time >= 0.4:\r\n    process_time = 0.0\r\n    if not self.playback:\r\n      self.playback = $AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback()\r\n      if not self.playback:\r\n        return\r\n    print(\"Playing clip %s at position %0.2f (total play time %0.2f)\" % [\r\n      self.playback.get_current_stream_index(), \r\n      self.playback.get_stream_playback_position(), \r\n      self.playback.get_playback_position()\r\n    ])\r\n\r\nfunc set_content():\r\n  var stream_idx = self.playback.get_current_stream_index()\r\n  var stream = self.playlist.get_list_stream(stream_idx)\r\n  print(\"Set content: %s\" % stream)\r\n  if not stream:\r\n    $Content/current_title.text = \"No stream at index %d\" % stream_idx\r\n    return\r\n  var stream_name = stream.resource_name if stream.resource_name else stream.resource_path\r\n  $Content/current_title.text = stream_name\r\n\r\nfunc on_stream_looped():\r\n  print(\"Stream looped!\")\r\n\r\nfunc on_stream_changed():\r\n  var stream_idx = self.playback.get_current_stream_index()\r\n  var stream = self.playlist.get_list_stream(stream_idx)\r\n  print(\"Stream changed: [%d] Now playing index %s\" % [stream_idx, stream])\r\n  self.set_content()\r\n\r\nfunc on_toggled(is_toggled: bool) -> void:\r\n  print(\"Setting stream loop to %s\" % is_toggled)\r\n  self.playlist.set_loop_stream(is_toggled)\r\n```\r\n\r\n![mix it dj](https://media.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExYmNocnNja3BqbWI3aWswMnNqcjgwYTQzYmZrcHVod2Fxb3d1MnN5dSZlcD12MV9naWZzX3NlYXJjaCZjdD1n/bj09BK2BzLLQk/giphy.gif)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4